Review of 'The Lean Startup' from the Downtown Library:

I checked out this book for a project on business models. The library copy was in good shape, though the previous borrower had left some notes in the margins. The return process was easy—just dropped it in the book drop. However, I noticed the library's online catalog had a glitch where it showed the book as still checked out after I returned it. A quick call to the library fixed it. The content itself is insightful, though a bit dated.

{
